---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Legal Notice (Impressum) | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Statutory legal notice and entity identification pursuant to § 5 German Digital Services Act (DDG) and Article 5 of EU E-Commerce Directive 2000/31/EC."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Statutory Information</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Legal Notice <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">(Impressum)</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Mandatory statutory provider disclosure pursuant to Section 5 of the German Digital Services Act (Digitale-Dienste-Gesetz - DDG) and Article 5 of Directive 2000/31/EC.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1: Operating Entity -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
          <span>Service Provider & Operator Information</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">Brand & Trade Name</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-base">EU DPP Provider</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Enterprise Digital Product Passport Systems & Sovereign Data Vaults</div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">Corporate Registration</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900">Nanjing Ningyi Cultural Media Co., Ltd. / EU Operations Desk</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Unified Social Credit Identifier: <span class="font-mono text-slate-700 font-bold">913201025685882797</span></div>
            <div class="text-slate-500">Legal Representative / Director: <span class="text-slate-800 font-medium">Zhu Min</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 2: Contact Information -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
          <span>Contact & Operating Centers</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">Official Electronic Business Desk</div>
            <div class="font-bold text-cyan-700 font-mono text-base">
              <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com">info@eudppprovider.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Response time: Within 24 business hours</div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="text-slate-400 font-mono uppercase text-xs mb-1">Data Hosting & Sovereign Cloud Nodes</div>
            <div class="text-slate-800 font-medium">ISO/IEC 27001 Certified Tier-IV Facilities</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Frankfurt am Main & Munich (Germany)</div>
            <div class="text-slate-500">eIDAS 2.0 QSeal Signing Authority: DigiCert EU / D-Trust</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Section 3: Professional Regulatory Disclaimers -->
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">3</span>
          <span>Regulatory Compliance & Dispute Resolution</span>
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            <strong>EU Commission Online Dispute Resolution (ODR):</strong> The European Commission provides an online dispute resolution platform accessible at <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cyan-700 underline">https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>. We are neither obligated nor willing to participate in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board, as our services are exclusively targeted at B2B commercial entities.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Regulatory Independence Disclaimer:</strong> EU DPP Provider is an independent compliance software vendor and sovereign data vault operator. References to Regulation (EU) 2023/1542, DG GROW DPP Central Registry, ISO standards, and Notified Bodies are for technical interoperability, compliance mapping, and onboarding support purposes. Interactive simulator data is provided for illustrative evaluation purposes.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
